<Document>
  <name>Epic Breezy Segment 4 - KGTF to KYKM</name>
  <description>Great Falls MT to Yakima WA, 20-24 August 2026. N149X. 9 legs, 9 airports, 4 flying days, ~535 nm, ~11.4 h airborne. Includes the 22 August crossing of Glacier National Park en route Kalispell to Eureka. 1 Hz GPS recorded by the wing-mounted GoPros; legs and airports derived from the telemetry and confirmed against the pilot-stated route.</description>
